A JavaScript file with a function whose parameter list never closes: the declarations before
and after the broken spot are listed, the class with its method, while the broken function and
the `const` it swallows sit in an `ERROR` node and are missing (techdebt.md, "Declarations inside
syntax errors are dropped").
